    "Gantry": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Gantry can manage Linux containers natively on your Mac with Apple's `container` runtime — but it isn't installed yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry can manage Linux containers natively on your Mac with Apple's `container` runtime — but it isn't installed yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry 可通过 Apple 的 `container` 运行时在 Mac 上原生管理 Linux 容器 — 但尚未安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gantry disconnects and removes the host. Containers on the host do not change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry disconnects and removes the host. Containers on the host do not change."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry 会断开并移除此主机。主机上的容器不会改变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gantry found no Docker socket (Docker Desktop, OrbStack, Colima, Rancher Desktop or Podman). Install one of them, or remove this host from the sidebar if you only use apple/container.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry found no Docker socket (Docker Desktop, OrbStack, Colima, Rancher Desktop or Podman). Install one of them, or remove this host from the sidebar if you only use apple/container."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry 未找到 Docker 套接字（Docker Desktop、OrbStack、Colima、Rancher Desktop 或 Podman）。请安装其中之一；如果只使用 apple/container，可从边栏移除此主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gantry includes a stdio MCP server, gantry-mcp, that exposes your Docker hosts as tools an AI agent can call: list containers, view logs and stats, run lifecycle actions, exec commands, and inspect images, volumes, networks and disk usage. Register it with an MCP client like Claude:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry includes a stdio MCP server, gantry-mcp, that exposes your Docker hosts as tools an AI agent can call: list containers, view logs and stats, run lifecycle actions, exec commands, and inspect images, volumes, networks and disk usage. Register it with an MCP client like Claude:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry 内置 stdio MCP 服务器 gantry-mcp，可将你的 Docker 主机暴露为 AI 代理可调用的工具：列出容器、查看日志与统计、执行生命周期操作、exec 命令，以及检查镜像、卷、网络与磁盘占用。可在 Claude 等 MCP 客户端中注册："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gantry is not connected to this host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry is not connected to this host."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry 未连接到此主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gantry resolves keys from your SSH config and the usual default identities.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry resolves keys from your SSH config and the usual default identities."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry 会从 SSH 配置与常见默认身份解析密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gantry ships App Intents, so common Docker actions are available system-wide. Run them from the Shortcuts app, ask Siri, or search for them in Spotlight — for example \"List Containers\", \"Start Container\", or \"Get Container Logs\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry ships App Intents, so common Docker actions are available system-wide. Run them from the Shortcuts app, ask Siri, or search for them in Spotlight — for example \"List Containers\", \"Start Container\", or \"Get Container Logs\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry 提供 App Intents，因此常用 Docker 操作可在系统范围内使用。可从“快捷指令”应用运行、向 Siri 提问，或在聚焦中搜索 — 例如“列出容器”、“启动容器”或“获取容器日志”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gantry will run `brew %@ %@` for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry will run `brew %@ %@` for you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry 将为你运行 `brew %@ %@`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gantry will run `brew install %@` for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry will run `brew install %@` for you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gantry 将为你运行 `brew install %@`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
