    "Star a domain to make it the default: new containers are assigned it automatically and resolve as name.domain across your Mac (after a services restart). Existing containers need to be recreated — use “Change DNS Name” on the container. Creating or removing a domain requires administrator approval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Star a domain to make it the default: new containers are assigned it automatically and resolve as name.domain across your Mac (after a services restart). Existing containers need to be recreated — use “Change DNS Name” on the container. Creating or removing a domain requires administrator approval."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将域名标星设为默认：新容器会自动分配该域名，并在重启服务后以 name.domain 在 Mac 上解析。现有容器需重建 — 请在容器上使用“更改 DNS 名称”。创建或删除域名需要管理员授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
